apklayer patch: a window's requested visible types come with its add. IWindowSession.addToDisplay[AsUser] carries them
(requestedVisibleTypes): ViewRootImpl.setView applies FLAG_FULLSCREEN, the theme's fullscreen and the legacy system UI flags to its
InsetsController before the add, and the controller tells the session nothing while the window is not added. ShadowWindowManagerGlobal
used a fresh WindowInfo's default (every bar visible), so each new activity window left fullscreen: PGR was fullscreen at its splash
and a window again a second later, when its main activity's window came. And only a window that can be DisplayPolicy's top
fullscreen window (an application window filling the display) decides the bars: a dialog, popup or toast keeps the activity's.
Against external/robolectric 87aa52b08 (REVISION), after 0004, 0019, 0022, 0026 and 0027.
